schema/skills is OASF's skill taxonomy, the directory as it is at that
commit: git tree 369dbe85b1086315e3cacaadd29dea6e2dfedd45
(git rev-parse 243e9dd1562529fdf59e3eb06db442d69330b14b:schema/skills).
A Record names a skill by its path in it and the id derived from that path
(server/lib/schema/types.ex: class_uid(category_uid, class_id) =
category_uid * 100 + class_id).

schema/modules is its module taxonomy, the same way: git tree
bd97cf285a47628f44687bd4cbf3ba71cce1e7a6. A Record names a module by its
path and the id derived from it, integration/a2a as 203.

